			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Darven looks up from his papers, and a bright smile stretches quickly across his face.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;WELL DONE! WELL DONE!&quot; He grabs his cup quickly, and raises it high to the cheers.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Ye've done good work, here, lord, good work indeed! May th' Great Spirit bless ye in all ye do from here out, and guide yer feet down th' true path!&quot; He raises his cup once, and then downs a deep swallow. Smiling, he sits, papers nearly forgotten before him, and listens to the others in the room.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
 
<br />
Darven Twopaws 
<br />
 Shaman<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
