		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15929&amp;sid=710b63825cb5ce14f0ec20f321fb6abd#15929"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Sep 12, 2002 9:21 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15929&amp;sid=710b63825cb5ce14f0ec20f321fb6abd"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The Iksarian Samurai blushes as much as the lizard can his tail thumping against the floor at Morani's Affection, &quot;well..&quot; he ahems and buries his snout in his cup of coffee. &quot;I just tried to do what I felt was the right thing, and as for leaking like a goblin's bucket... Well that's a common occurance for me I think.&quot; he chuckles brightly, &quot;But I don't think lucan was fated to win upon that day... I think Mithaniel Marr had become tired of the death and destruction the fallen knight had caused.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
The samurai smiles for a moment, &quot;And yet, I still feel as though I have unlocked a pandora's box of sorts upon myself.&quot; he sighs, &quot;With this title and fame, there will be many who will wish to carve a name out of my hide.&quot; He laughs brightly for a moment, &quot;It would seem that I would have become the dragon I once was, adventurers wishing to carve a name for themselves out of my hinnie. Well I guess the only thing to do would be to keep my tail away from sharp objects now huh m'lady?&quot; He smiles at Morani and gives her a lizard's lick. &quot;Thank you again m'lady both for your friendship and affection. It does much to warm this tired samurai's heart.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatuskao Flamespewer
<br />

<br />
High Master of Dragons, Shogun of the 56th Rank
<br />

<br />
Guardians of Honor
<br />

<br />
Test Server 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
<br />
White Lotus Samurai of the 65th Rank
<br />
High Guardian Of Veeshan
<br />
Zen Cabal
<br />

<br />
